      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『汝，莫要止步于此等微末之事』——\n它正在向我传达这样的旨意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcbbd28c5edd9f179e3fe6751c154b8948a84665a02aa143211d683f573ca069",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
