    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aecab935ad427ea56760056b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的！无论面对怎样的艰难险阻，我也绝不会屈膝认输！\n哪怕是这项考验，我也定将彻底跨越！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2aaa5c6e6da010269354e078d07f22105ae0c151523bc0d5dff2771429d690",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136005.json",
      "json_path": [
