    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a711af23895b6318bb2eb5ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e699a1b8e6d2d19e97b3d0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没关系，请不用在意。用圣女的力量，我一定能把它找出来的。\n那本书所散发出的玛那——哈！我感应到了，就在那个书架上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f07c050606e2a28fdd62d2293888a52d6cf925432a24802484fbc048c5cef3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136005.json",
      "json_path": [
