    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc1a5856e71fed7be4fcf788",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成为红色梦想的担当训练员已经过了几天。从日常生活中的细节，\n我再次深切地体会到，她对『异世界』的憧憬绝对是极其认真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5897f16b7ee10c4d777a60e664616d7cbea3a38049e83e0909c673371f265f97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136005.json",
      "json_path": [
