    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1843263f785b3af38b401a0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美化委员赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "f80effab93c58b5e7c25961556270e218063bb0464d1de607bab7a67122f749d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc5cdd92c3f2c6048b255b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确实，不管是千振还是延命草，在家里也并非种不活。\n但是，那真的真的非常苦哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "830dd99da58bdd5c2f88d9f7fb814cee34f67f1876bbe6bca61c340e1051b9a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
